Package: audiofile
Version: 0.2.6-r2
Description: The Audio File Library provides a uniform and elegant API for accessing a variety of audio file formats, such as AIFF/AIFF-C, WAVE, NeXT/Sun .snd/.au, Berkeley/IRCAM/CARL Sound File, Audio Visual Research, Amiga IFF/8SVX, and NIST SPHERE.
Section: libs
Priority: optional
Maintainer: OpenEmbedded Team <oe@handhelds.org>
Architecture: armv5te
Source: http://www.68k.org/~michael/audiofile/audiofile-0.2.6.tar.gz
Depends: audiofile (>= 0.2.6), libc6 (>= 2.3.2+cvs20040726), libgcc1 (>= 3.4.1)
